<title>INDIA: Bombay index ends 98.86 pts lower at 3,002.41.</title>
<headline>Bombay index ends 98.86 pts lower at 3,002.41.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 30-share index of the Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) closed at a provisional 98.86 points or 3.19 percent lower at 3,002.41 on Monday after tumbling 161 points or 5.2 percent in midday trade, dealers said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
